# === Odin build outputs ===
build/
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.exp
*.lib
*.obj

# === Personal / private paths ===
# Personal content (PVG03_RPG/, _Private/, paywalled scraped content) is tracked on
# LOCAL main via `git add -f`, never on the public branch.
# See _Helpers/docs/007_mixing_public_and_private_history.md for the full workflow.
#
# Collaborators cloning this repo should copy the corresponding patterns from
# .git/info/exclude (this file is LOCAL only, not version-controlled) if they want
# a clean `git status`. The pre-push hook (.git/hooks/pre-push) is the real
# enforcement - it refuses pushes of personal paths to the public remote.
#
# Only the secrets pattern is kept in this tracked .gitignore as defense in depth,
# so credentials never reach any remote even if a private one is added later.
/_Private/.config/

# === Vendored third-party templates (each has its own .git/ - never `git add` the contents) ===
/code/vendored templates/*/
!/code/vendored templates/README - vendored templates.md

# === Secrets / state ===
.env
**/.private/

# === Python ===
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# === Logs ===
*.log
_Helpers/logs/

# === Node ===
**/node_modules/

# === OS / IDE ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.vscode/*
# but user tasks.json is tracked for the benefit of collaborators, so we don't ignore it:
!.vscode/tasks.json

# === Zed project config ===
# Mirror of the .vscode/* pattern above: the .zed/ folder is versioned so that
# every collaborator gets the same Odin-aware keymap + tasks + LSP wiring.
# Personal / cosmetic preferences (font, theme, MCP tokens, agent LLM)
# remain at user level in ~/AppData/Roaming/Zed/settings.json - they are
# NEVER versioned.
.zed/*
!.zed/settings.json
!.zed/keymap.json
!.zed/tasks.json
!.zed/README - zed.md

# === Kilo runtime state ===
.kilo/worktrees/
.kilo/agent-manager.json
.kilo/sessions/
.kilo/cache/
.kilo/mcp.json

# === Skill sandbox ===
.kilo/skills/*/_index_*.md
.kilo/skills/*/local.patch

# === Obsidian ===
/.obsidian

# === Backups ===
BAK/
*backups/
*.bak
*.zip
